,
{
  "testcase": {
    "source_name": "665f97bf-5c5d-4cac-a1e6-79662545af5c",
    "source_text": [
      "Achieving Your Learning Goals with Ella By now, you\u2019ve learned how to consume content in the language you want to learn\u2014hopefully even uploading some of your own and experiencing it through Ella.\nMost traditional language learning methods are boring, repetitive, and disconnected from your life.\nThey often force you to work through content you wouldn\u2019t normally choose to engage with.\nElla takes a different approach: it helps you reach fluency by using content you already enjoy\u2014no drills, no repetition, just real-life language exposure.\nThe real question now is: how much will you use it?\nThink about the months ahead.\nIf you spend a few hours each week engaging with your new language, it\u2019s only a matter of time before your brain starts to adapt.\nYou\u2019ll grow more comfortable with the language and steadily build your vocabulary.\nThe key is creating a habit.\nThe easiest way to integrate Ella into your daily life is to choose content you already consume\u2014and simply experience it through Ella in the new language.\nDo you read work-related articles or weekly blogs?\nSubscribe to a favorite newsletter?\nGet frequent emails from your child\u2019s school?\nIf you start consuming this type of content with Ella, you\u2019re already well on your way to reaching your language goals.\nJust give it time\u2014and the results will come.\nAt Ella, our mission is to help you succeed.\nWe believe that building a habit around content you enjoy is the most effective path to fluency.\nTell us how you're creating this habit and how well it\u2019s working.\nYour experience helps us improve Ella\u2014and helps others learn too.\n"
    ],
    "source_config": "en-US,C2,,",
    "target_config": "ja-JP,A1,,"
  },
  "testconf": {},
