    "source_name": "2056aae0-0be0-42ed-8b90-eae8d78acc6d",
    "source_text": [
      "I\u2019m personally very excited about this time of year, the lead up to winter break and everything that entails is something I\u2019ve always enjoyed.\nMy December is also shaping up to be an early New Year\u2019s resolution month with healthier eating, less alcohol consumption, earlier bedtimes, earlier wake ups (our son Bode has 5:30am soccer practice in LIC and we live in Tribeca!) and finally working out and stretching more - more on that later.\nDecember also brings the start of all access members lockers and laundry service.\nThis was a long time in the making and shout out to longtime member Anirudh for taking Jess aside and telling her it's time :) The racquet storage facility is surprisingly difficult and we are deciding between it being manufactured or a slightly less bespoke option - either way it\u2019s on the way.\nCourttech, our court manufacturer, will be coming to repair the front wall of court 3 in two weeks, fix the netting between courts and will be looking at our floors to give advice with both grip and ball wear and tear.\n"
    ],
