    "source_text": [
      "After months of putting it off, I finally got around to cleaning out the attic.\nI thought it would be a quick job, but as soon as I started digging through old boxes, memories started flooding back.\nI stumbled upon my grandfather\u2019s journal and couldn\u2019t help but flip through a few pages.\nBefore I knew it, hours had slipped by, and I hadn\u2019t even made a dent in the clutter.\nI was about to give up when I came across a photo album from my childhood\u2014it was enough to keep me going for another hour.\nBy the time I wrapped up, the sun was setting, and I had only scratched the surface.\nStill, it felt good to tackle something I\u2019d been putting off for so long.\n"
    ],
