    "source_text": [
      "I think a pattern that helps avoid things like this is grouping associated state together, so you would have some kind of response state with data and status as members.\nYou're already setting their state at the same time here.\nSo you could make sure they \"batch\" that way.\nI know you're using this as an example to show the actual batching behavior of react but I thought I'd throw that out there.\n"
