{
  "testcase": {
    "source_name": "4f63d227-5c89-45ef-ac05-07919ef8a6eb",
    "source_text": [
      "Dear awesome squash community, I love bullet points, so here we go....\nthis year in squash I'm most grateful for: \u2022 this community.\nThank you for all your support and interest in what we are working to do in the squash space and beyond.\n\u2022 our team.\nWe wouldn't be anywhere without the incredible team that has chosen to work with Peter and I over many years.\nWe wouldn't have fun throughout the highs and lows of building a business without each and every member of the team.\n\u2022 our members.\nOur members truly bring us joy.\nThese folks love learning, playing, staying active and socializing.\nTo me - this is what life is all about.\nI'm lucky (and/or intentional) to surround myself with these types of folks, most importantly my husband - that guy named Nicol who personifies these traits every day!\n\u2022 squash in the Olympics.\nHECK YES!\n\u2022 pickleball and padel.\nPickleball IMHO has led to a greater interest in racquet sports in general (incl squash), and Padel is breathing further fresh air into this industry.\n\u2022 our new 20,000 sq ft club that is opening imminently in NJ (ahem, 5 months late) with both sports listed above, Spear Physical Therapy and of course squash!\n\u2022 last but not least - lockers, laundry & video (playback available to members at a fee)...\nabout time as many let me know!!\nFrom ours to yours, near and far...\nlet's lift each other up and enjoy a tremendous year ahead.\nHappy 2025!!!\nThank you!\n"
    ],
    "source_config": "en-US,C2,,",
    "target_config": "it-IT,B2,,"
  },
