    "source_text": [
      "Flux has four key components: Actions: Objects that contain information (such as user interactions) and are dispatched to the dispatcher.\nDispatcher: Central hub that sends the action to all registered stores.\nStores: Containers that hold the application state.\nThey respond to actions and update the state accordingly.\nView (React Components): The UI that listens to the stores for state changes and re-renders accordingly.\n"
    ],
