    "source_text": [
      "Alpha Testers Start Here: Your Ella Walkthrough Welcome to Ella!\nThanks for joining our early testing phase.\nAs an alpha tester, you\u2019re among the first to try Ella.\nYour feedback is important, and we\u2019re excited to have you on this journey.\nElla aims to make language learning a natural part of your daily life\u2014no more lessons or drills.\nInstead, you\u2019ll learn from content that\u2019s relevant to your world and built around your vocabulary.\nThis could be a podcast, a blog post, a business memo, or an interesting article.\nElla breaks this content into short phrases matched to your skill level.\nYou can listen while doing other things, or follow the text on screen.\nPlay around with the settings.\nTry changing the voice speed and the time between phrases.\nIf you spot an error in a phrase or its translation, click the three dots next to it to report it.\nTry saving words you want to learn.\nClick on a word to highlight it, then click the saved words icon near the settings to generate memorization prompts.\nThis is a proven way to absorb a large amount of new vocabulary with very little effort.\nLastly, please share your feedback.\nAnswer the survey and schedule a call with us to discuss your experience.\n"
    ],
    "source_config": "en-US,C2,,",
    "target_config": "ja-JP,A1,,"
