    "source_name": "6c30e066-b54d-484c-b384-c8c102c98f89",
    "source_text": [
      "A low rumble echoed across the dawn-lit plain as Lieutenant Mara Novak pressed her hand against the sleek steel hull of the M4 Sherman \u201cIron Dawn.\u201d Built for battles she hoped never to fight, the tank\u2019s engine purred to life under her calm command.\nTogether with her crew\u2014Corporal Reyes, Sergeant Huxley, and Private Kim\u2014they moved across fields scarred by yesterday\u2019s fighting.\nAt first light, an enemy patrol appeared on the horizon.\nMara\u2019s heart tightened, but she steadied her voice over the intercom: \u201cPrepare to engage.\nKeep your focus on cover and observation.\u201d Corporal Reyes manned the machine gun, Sergeant Huxley adjusted the gun sight, and Private Kim scanned for threats.\nWhen the opposing vehicles closed in, Mara aimed Iron Dawn\u2019s main cannon with precision born of long drills\u2014and fired.\nThe earth shook; the patrol retreated.\nSmoke drifted across the battered landscape.\nMara climbed out, wiping oil from her brow as her crew gathered around.\nDespite the chaos, they exchanged relieved smiles.\nUnderneath the scarlet sunrise, the Iron Dawn stood silent witness to their victory\u2014and to the promise that, together, they could drive back any darkness the battlefield might bring.\n"
    ],
    "source_config": "en-US,C2,,",
    "target_config": "es-ES,A1,,"
  },
