{
  "testcase": {
    "source_name": "f32feeed-3d08-4485-a7e4-b786a82d5ce4",
    "source_text": [
      "Alpha Testers Start Here: Your Ella Walkthrough + Pro Tips Welcome to Ella!\nThanks for joining our early testing phase.\nAs an alpha tester, you\u2019re among the first to try Ella.\nYour feedback matters, and we\u2019re excited to have you on this journey.\nElla aims to make language learning a part of your daily life.\nNo more lessons or drills.\nInstead, you\u2019ll learn from content that connects to your world and uses your vocabulary.\nThis could be a blog post, a business memo, or an interesting article.\nElla splits this content into short phrases to match your skill level.\nYou\u2019ll also hear audio to help you follow along.\nPlay around with the settings, you can pause or replay the audio, skip back a few seconds, or move forward at your own pace.\nYou can change the font size for both languages.\nAdjust text and make them larger or smaller.\nYou can adjust your skip interval for a smoother experience.\nIf a phrase and its translation have an error, click the three dots and report it We recommend trying the save function.\nIf you find a word or phrase you want to remember, just save it.\nElla will hold onto it, plus the translation and context from your content.\nThis gives you a vocabulary list that you can access anytime.\nThis feature is great for work.\nYou can upload internal documents or emails.\nThis helps you learn the language used in your field.\nElla is built on how people learn best.\nYou won't memorize grammar rules.\nInstead, you'll see language in context.\nThis will be just a bit above your current level.\nThis exposure opens up deeper learning pathways.\nIt helps you absorb patterns easily, just like how we learn our first language.\nThe more you interact with content you love, the faster and easier you will learn.\nElla also adapts to you.\nOur AI processes each piece of content behind the scenes.\nIt breaks it down and changes the level of translation and support for you.\nIt\u2019s a strong technology that feels easy.\nIt helps you grow your skills clearly over time.\nThere\u2019s no fixed path.\nYou choose what to explore and how to engage.\nElla is perfect for you.\nYou can chat for five minutes over coffee or dive into a full article.\nShe matches your time, interests, and goals\n"
    ],
    "source_config": "en-US,C2,,",
    "target_config": "zh-CN,A1,,"
  },
